```

3. Generate unique random values:

```c
int generateUniqueRandomValue(size_t *values, size_t arraySize, size_t minValue, size_t maxValue) {
    int value;
    do {
        value = (rand() % ((maxValue - minValue + 1) + 1)) + minValue;
    } while (findIndex(values, arraySize, value) != SIZE_MAX);
    values[arraySize] = value;
    return value;
}
```

4. Find the index of a given value in an array:

```c
size_t findIndex(const int *values, size_t arraySize, int value) {
    for (size_t i = 0; i < arraySize; ++i) {
        if (values[i] == value) {
            return i;
        }
    }
    return SIZE_MAX;
}
```

5. Main function to create the data structures and perform other tasks:

