The code utilizes a linked list collision resolution strategy and supports batch insertion of entries. The hash function used is a simple one for demonstration purposes, but can be replaced with more sophisticated options as needed. The function also includes error handling, logging, and thread safety using pthreads, ensuring consistent data views across concurrent processes.

